@prefix ex: <http://example.org/ont#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
ex:Alpha a owl:Class . ex:Beta a owl:Class . ex:Gamma a owl:Class . ex:Delta a owl:Class .
ex:p1 a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Alpha .
ex:p2 a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Beta .
ex:p3 a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Gamma .
ex:p4 a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Delta .
